abstract: >-
  An offline visual and sonic parameter atlas for comparing Buckminster Fuller's
  Synergetics, QSOL-IMC research, selected Brian Thorne software structures,
  Paul Hawken's regenerative frameworks, and Buddhist Middle Way training using
  explicit mapping classes, provenance, residuals and rejected relations.
